WEBVTT

00:16.540 --> 00:18.200
<b>Attention, deck crew.</b>

00:18.250 --> 00:21.790
<b>Deck 3 and 4's hatches will be open
for landing operations.</b>

00:21.830 --> 00:25.700
<b>Don helmets immediately
or move to an airtight area.</b>

00:25.750 --> 00:27.660
<b>Message from Moore Brotherhood:</b>

00:27.700 --> 00:31.790
<b>Begin all-out assault to retake
Thunderbolt Sector in two hours.</b>

00:31.830 --> 00:33.200
<b>Message ends.</b>

00:33.250 --> 00:35.660
<b>Guncannons, 4.
GM Cannons, 20.</b>

00:35.700 --> 00:39.080
<b>Balls, 12.
Supply containers, 40.</b>

00:39.120 --> 00:41.830
<b>40 relief pilots have also arrived.</b>

00:42.410 --> 00:44.410
<b>We appreciate the fresh pilots.</b>

00:45.290 --> 00:47.700
<b>I guess this was
the little girl's breaking point.</b>

00:47.750 --> 00:48.790
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

01:04.950 --> 01:07.830
<b>Now pressurizing decks.</b>

01:07.870 --> 01:11.330
<b>New pilots, report to briefing room.</b>

01:12.620 --> 01:16.250
<b>Deck 4, mobile suit berthing
operations complete.</b>

01:16.290 --> 01:18.200
<b>Begin closing gate!</b>

01:18.750 --> 01:20.750
<b>Check all safeties!</b>

01:20.790 --> 01:24.000
<b>- Hang on, they're all kids!</b>

01:25.330 --> 01:26.370
<b>A Gundam!</b>

01:27.700 --> 01:29.000
<b>It's a Gundam!</b>

01:31.160 --> 01:32.200
<b>What the- -?</b>

01:39.620 --> 01:41.120
<b>They're your men.</b>

01:41.160 --> 01:43.500
<b>Take good care of them, Commander Io.</b>

01:43.540 --> 01:45.160
<b>What a sick joke.</b>

01:47.040 --> 01:48.620
<b>Little patriots, huh?</b>

01:49.450 --> 01:52.870
<b>This explains why the Federation is
sending out multiple Gundam prototypes.</b>

01:53.790 --> 01:55.910
<b>- Hey! Captain!</b>

01:55.950 --> 01:57.450
<b>- Ensign, please!</b>

01:57.500 --> 01:59.200
<b>Screw you! Get lost!</b>

02:04.620 --> 02:06.660
<b>Hey! Claudia!</b>

02:08.040 --> 02:10.830
<b>Wake up! Claudia!</b>

02:11.580 --> 02:13.660
<b>Wait, are you- -</b>

02:13.700 --> 02:15.330
<b>You're an officer, damn it!</b>

02:17.000 --> 02:19.290
<b>What the hell are you thinking?!</b>

02:19.330 --> 02:21.910
<b>- How long have you been using?!
- Ow! You're hurting me!</b>

02:23.370 --> 02:24.580
<b>Now I...</b>

02:25.750 --> 02:30.040
<b>Now I understand how your father felt!</b>

02:32.120 --> 02:36.200
<b>When he was ground down</b>

02:36.250 --> 02:38.120
<b>by the reality that he let hundreds
of millions of Moore citizens die!</b>

02:39.750 --> 02:42.700
<b>Io, you don't know what it's like.</b>

02:43.620 --> 02:47.200
<b>I'm going to order more
people to their deaths!</b>

02:47.870 --> 02:51.580
<b>Even those children who were
sent here like expendable goods!</b>

02:51.620 --> 02:56.080
<b>You should be feeling
this same pain, too!</b>

03:01.540 --> 03:04.120
<b>- That's amazing!
- That's our ace sniper!</b>

03:04.160 --> 03:07.660
<b>A special two-rank promotion!
Here's to the Ensign!</b>

03:08.200 --> 03:09.950
<b>Show us your insignia!</b>

03:10.000 --> 03:11.450
<b>Just this once.</b>

03:14.120 --> 03:15.870
<b>That's so cool!</b>

03:16.750 --> 03:18.290
<b>Want a belt, Ensign?</b>

03:26.540 --> 03:29.000
<b>I didn't mean to...
Sorry.</b>

03:29.830 --> 03:30.910
<b>Don't mind me...</b>

03:32.700 --> 03:35.950
<b>Don't be like that.
Are you guys all weepy drunks?</b>

03:37.250 --> 03:39.750
<b>Thanks for throwing
this party for me.</b>

03:41.040 --> 03:43.410
<b>I'm okay with it, don't worry.</b>

03:43.450 --> 03:44.950
<b>It was an order.</b>

03:45.000 --> 03:47.620
<b>And I want to protect my fleetmates.</b>

03:48.450 --> 03:52.000
<b>In fact, it was an honor to be asked.</b>

03:59.120 --> 04:01.700
<b>These pictures sure take me back.</b>

04:03.410 --> 04:06.540
<b>I remember the Colony Air Race
like it was yesterday.</b>

04:07.950 --> 04:10.540
<b>That was such a huge win.</b>

04:11.290 --> 04:15.040
<b>We did everything ourselves, didn't we?</b>

04:15.080 --> 04:16.870
<b>From the planning to the sponsor hunting.</b>

04:19.080 --> 04:22.790
<b>I thought that we could
do everything ourselves.</b>

04:24.450 --> 04:28.410
<b>I still see those days in my dreams.</b>

04:28.450 --> 04:30.200
<b>Drugs can't take you back.</b>

04:31.950 --> 04:34.290
<b>Io doesn't actually enjoy war.</b>

04:35.290 --> 04:38.370
<b>He's just the type of person
who only feels alive</b>

04:38.410 --> 04:41.450
<b>when he pushes himself to the limit.</b>

04:42.450 --> 04:47.000
<b>He can only live
in the madness of war.</b>

04:47.870 --> 04:49.500
<b>I feel sorry for him.</b>

04:58.540 --> 05:00.040
<b>Ensign Daryl!</b>

05:00.080 --> 05:01.620
<b>We'll be heading out first.</b>

05:08.830 --> 05:10.250
<b>Move closer!</b>

05:10.290 --> 05:13.040
<b>Closer, closer!</b>

05:13.080 --> 05:14.290
<b>Closer, closer!</b>

05:15.410 --> 05:19.870
<b>Our mobile suit force will begin
the operation at 2400 hours.</b>

05:20.410 --> 05:22.870
<b>Act as my shield.</b>

05:22.910 --> 05:25.870
<b>I'll be avoiding
any random skirmishes en route.</b>

05:26.750 --> 05:29.450
<b>The Full Armor Gundam's sole mission</b>

05:29.500 --> 05:33.870
<b>is to destroy the enemy fleet and
eliminate the enemy's ace sniper.</b>

05:35.250 --> 05:39.410
<b>This is a messed-up world where
someone who kills lots of people</b>

05:39.450 --> 05:40.700
<b>gets praised as a hero.</b>

05:41.950 --> 05:45.330
<b>An endless loop of
planning ops and fighting.</b>

05:45.370 --> 05:47.120
<b>Even if the players change,</b>

05:47.160 --> 05:49.500
<b>the mission we call war continues.</b>

05:50.290 --> 05:53.000
<b>Try to ignore it all you want,
but there's no escaping it.</b>

05:55.000 --> 05:56.540
<b>I love mobile suits.</b>

05:57.410 --> 06:01.370
<b>I'm hopelessly in love with
these machines that amplify my abilities.</b>

06:01.410 --> 06:03.200
<b>It gets me fired up from head to toe.</b>

06:04.370 --> 06:08.410
<b>Call it bad karma
or sinful or whatever,</b>

06:09.040 --> 06:12.120
<b>but I'll break free of anything
that ties me down</b>

06:12.160 --> 06:15.040
<b>and keep fighting to the brink of hell itself.</b>

06:16.750 --> 06:20.410
<b>Farewell, my brother and sister
fellow expendables.</b>

06:21.250 --> 06:23.080
<b>If any of us survive, I'm buying.</b>

06:29.950 --> 06:31.330
<b>This is Io Fleming.</b>

06:31.370 --> 06:33.750
<b>Full Armor Gundam, launching!</b>

06:45.250 --> 06:47.040
<b>All you innocent children...</b>

06:48.290 --> 06:50.370
<b>Please, come back safely.</b>

06:50.410 --> 06:51.950
<b>As many as possible.</b>

06:58.200 --> 07:00.830
<b>My father is a historian.</b>

07:01.830 --> 07:04.580
<b>He's in prison right now
as a dissident.</b>

07:06.370 --> 07:11.250
<b>The military said he'd be spared if I helped
the war effort with my research.</b>

07:13.160 --> 07:17.040
<b>My father was the sort of man
who kept on fighting</b>

07:17.790 --> 07:20.200
<b>even after many attempts on
his life and losing his left hand,</b>

07:21.290 --> 07:23.540
<b>but I did as I was told
and cut off your right arm.</b>

07:28.080 --> 07:31.250
<b>Out of ego and self-preservation.</b>

07:31.290 --> 07:32.500
<b>Let's survive this.</b>

07:35.410 --> 07:38.700
<b>Let's survive and laugh from
the bottom of our hearts someday.</b>

07:41.160 --> 07:43.160
<b>This irrational reality is the real enemy</b>

07:43.200 --> 07:45.580
<b>that's making us suffer.</b>

07:47.410 --> 07:49.410
<b>Those of us who live in times of war</b>

07:49.450 --> 07:50.910
<b>undergo lots of little ordeals,</b>

07:52.040 --> 07:55.040
<b>and maybe it's a miracle
just to survive in this war,</b>

07:56.750 --> 07:59.040
<b>but I'm sure that there are miracles</b>

07:59.870 --> 08:01.660
<b>even in lives as dark as ours.</b>

08:12.870 --> 08:16.290
<b>I want to laugh from
the bottom of my heart.</b>

08:19.750 --> 08:22.080
<b>- Ensign Daryl.
- Yes, sir.</b>

08:22.120 --> 08:25.080
<b>Everything hinges on your success.</b>

08:25.120 --> 08:28.700
<b>I apologize for being unable to salute,
but roger that, sir.</b>

08:28.750 --> 08:30.040
<b>We're all counting on you.</b>

08:39.200 --> 08:41.290
<b>Daryl Lorenz, launching.</b>

08:57.000 --> 09:00.870
<b>Damn, they're like tidy candles
on a birthday cake out there.</b>

09:00.910 --> 09:03.290
<b>But they just have numbers...</b>

09:09.120 --> 09:10.040
<b>- Philip!</b>

09:10.080 --> 09:11.000
<b>- Where is he?!</b>

09:11.040 --> 09:13.080
<b>- Hold fire! Hold fire!</b>

09:13.120 --> 09:14.040
<b>- People have been hit!</b>

09:14.080 --> 09:15.700
<b>We can't win with uncoordinated fire!</b>

09:15.750 --> 09:17.250
<b>We'll be wiped out like this!</b>

09:19.370 --> 09:20.450
<b>Okay, then...</b>

09:22.040 --> 09:24.370
<b>If I can keep their formation split up...</b>

09:26.910 --> 09:29.160
<b>...this'll be easier than slicing
a cake with a knife.</b>

09:29.950 --> 09:32.040
<b>We have to do it like in training!</b>

09:32.080 --> 09:33.450
<b>Link up with each other!</b>

09:33.500 --> 09:34.540
<b>- Crap, we lost another!</b>

09:34.580 --> 09:36.660
<b>- Shut up! Don't break forma- -</b>

09:36.700 --> 09:37.790
<b>Chief!</b>

09:37.830 --> 09:40.660
<b>Crap, they've started forming up again!</b>

09:41.330 --> 09:44.830
<b>Man, it's been forever since the last time</b>

09:44.870 --> 09:46.910
<b>I had a slice of Grandma's apple tart.</b>

09:56.250 --> 09:58.040
<b>We got him... We got him!</b>

10:01.250 --> 10:03.120
<b>I'll be joining you soon!</b>

10:14.250 --> 10:15.750
<b>Now on penetration route.</b>

10:15.790 --> 10:17.290
<b>Everything going according to plan.</b>

10:17.830 --> 10:19.250
<b>Target acquired.</b>

10:19.290 --> 10:21.950
<b>Take it from here, Petty Officer Layton.</b>

10:22.000 --> 10:23.040
<b>Roger that.</b>

10:28.700 --> 10:30.540
<b>Gotta wait 200 seconds...</b>

10:30.580 --> 10:32.700
<b>Keep it together, Layton!</b>

10:33.200 --> 10:34.790
<b>Prof. Karla!</b>

10:34.830 --> 10:38.330
<b>Are you planning to go down with this ship?</b>

10:38.370 --> 10:41.750
<b>Thanks to my work with that weapon,</b>

10:41.790 --> 10:44.250
<b>I've learned how the world works
and realized what a fool I am.</b>

10:44.290 --> 10:45.950
<b>Thank you, Sexton.</b>

10:46.000 --> 10:47.620
<b>We should escape!</b>

10:47.660 --> 10:49.750
<b>If we bring your research back to the homeland,
Zeon can- -</b>

10:49.790 --> 10:51.750
<b>Escape by yourself.</b>

10:51.790 --> 10:53.580
<b>The device is complete.</b>

10:53.620 --> 10:55.080
<b>You don't have to babysit me anymore, right?</b>

10:55.120 --> 10:56.580
<b>No, but- -</b>

10:57.790 --> 10:58.870
<b>The data!</b>

11:02.160 --> 11:03.450
<b>Professor!</b>

11:04.040 --> 11:06.660
<b>I don't believe it...
Fine, have it your way!</b>

11:18.200 --> 11:20.370
<b>Professor! Relax!</b>

11:20.410 --> 11:22.910
<b>Do it like in your military
training and you'll be fine!</b>

11:34.200 --> 11:35.330
<b>It's the Gundam!</b>

11:43.830 --> 11:45.790
<b>Damn you, Gundam!</b>

12:03.660 --> 12:04.790
<b>It's time!</b>

12:12.040 --> 12:14.330
<b>I did it!
I did it, Ensign!</b>

12:14.370 --> 12:16.000
<b>I did it! I did- -</b>

13:17.000 --> 13:19.000
<b>Engineering hit!</b>

13:19.040 --> 13:21.330
<b>Give me a damage report!</b>

13:21.370 --> 13:23.830
<b>We can't afford to go down here- -</b>

13:35.830 --> 13:38.040
<b>Load the wounded into the pods first!</b>

13:38.080 --> 13:39.700
<b>This one is packed, too...</b>

13:40.540 --> 13:42.620
<b>- This man's injured!
- Give us a hand!</b>

13:42.660 --> 13:43.830
<b>- Hey, are you all right?</b>

13:43.870 --> 13:44.950
<b>- Let's get him into a pod!</b>

13:45.000 --> 13:46.120
<b>Right.</b>

13:59.330 --> 14:00.450
<b>Graham!</b>

14:01.750 --> 14:04.040
<b>XO Graham, are you all right?</b>

14:08.000 --> 14:09.620
<b>Get your hands off me.</b>

14:10.200 --> 14:12.160
<b>The ship's about to go up.</b>

14:12.200 --> 14:13.830
<b>I've given the order to abandon ship.</b>

14:13.870 --> 14:15.040
<b>You did what?</b>

14:16.500 --> 14:18.120
<b>You're abandoning ship?!</b>

14:20.120 --> 14:22.160
<b>You incompetent elites... First you cost us</b>

14:22.200 --> 14:25.700
<b>our homeland, and now our fleet!</b>

14:26.370 --> 14:31.250
<b>You think I can look my late wife
and daughter in the eye if I run?</b>

14:31.290 --> 14:32.410
<b>Graham...</b>

14:33.200 --> 14:35.540
<b>For the honor of Moore.</b>

14:40.540 --> 14:42.160
<b>I'll be joining you.</b>

15:06.620 --> 15:08.080
<b>Claudia?</b>

15:10.330 --> 15:11.870
<b>Hey, what was that light?</b>

15:11.910 --> 15:13.750
<b>That blast was huge!</b>

15:13.790 --> 15:15.910
<b>That wasn't our mothership, was it?</b>

15:18.160 --> 15:20.540
<b>The battle's not over yet.</b>

15:20.580 --> 15:24.410
<b>There's still a powerful enemy in there.</b>

15:24.450 --> 15:27.040
<b>He wasn't in this combat zone.</b>

15:30.000 --> 15:31.620
<b>It's you, isn't it?</b>
